<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10009] ODBC: SQLColumns does not work for tables with escape sequences in name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10009</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Table names with escaped underscore &apos;&amp;#95;&apos; or percent &apos;&amp;#37;&apos; characters is not recognized by the ODBC driver. I.e. the following table pattern:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;TEST\_TABLE
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should match the following table:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;TEST_TABLE
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But currently it does not. Needs to be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
